= Our forces

With our decision to back the KPD, refuting the bourgeois claim that the KPD was also responsible for the death of Bruning, we have been forced to protect our selves from the wrath of the state.

- @reichsbanner_menu: The Reichsbanner
- @rfb_menu: Cooperation with the RFB.
- @return: Perhaps another time.
- @easy_discard

@reichsbanner_menu

The Reichsbanner is one of our most important tools for controling violence on the streets.

[? if rb_strength_add < 200 : Recruiting is impacted. ?] [? if rb_strength_add >= 200 and rb_strength_add < 300 : Recruiting is normal. ?] [? if rb_strength_add >= 300 : Recruiting has been expanded. ?]

[? if rb_militancy_add < 0.1 : Our militarization efforts are hampered. ?] [? if rb_militancy_add >= 0.1 and rb_militancy_add < 1.5 : Our militarization efforts are normal. ?] [? if rb_militancy_add >= 1.5 : Our militarization efforts have been expanded. ?]

What should we do?

- @reichsbanner_free: Recruit for the reichsbanner
- @reichsbanner: Fund reichsbanner
- @militarize: Militarize the reichsbanner
- @defund: We defund????
- @return: Perhaps another time.
- @easy_discard

@reichsbanner
subtitle: -1 resource
choose-if: resources > 0
on-arrival: rb_militancy +=0.05; month_actions +=1; paramilitaries_timer = 2; resources -=1; rb_strength += rb_strength_add / 2

We fund the Reichsbanner.

@reichsbanner_free
on-arrival: rb_strength +=100; month_actions +=1; paramilitaries_timer = 2; rb_strength += rb_strength_add / 3

We can use our media empire to find new reichsbanner recruits. 

@militarize
subtitle: -3 resources, this will be less effective if we were to use connections in the military instead.
choose-if: resources > 2 
on-arrival: month_actions +=1; paramilitaries_timer = 2; resource -=3; rb_militancy += rb_militancy_add * 1.5

The Reichsbanner now has munitions meant for military use.

@defund
subtitle: Why?, +3 resources
on-arrival: rb_dissent +=50; resources +=3; rb_strength *= 0.9; paramilitaries_timer = 2; rb_militancy *= 0.9

Alright then. The Reichsbanner will remember this. 

